<p>
  Plausible Analytics counts page views, where visitors came from, how long they stay and how far
  they scroll, their country and device, and these actions: picking a book up, opening it,
  opening Ask the library. It records which book, never what you ask. It sets no cookies; it sees your address and browser, and keeps only a hash
  of them that changes every day.
</p>
